[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4817011698","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120661#issuecomment-4817011698","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120661","id":4817011698,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHx3D8g","user":{"login":"Stavrolet","id":163565472,"node_id":"U_kgDOCb_PoA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163565472?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stavrolet","html_url":"https://github.com/Stavrolet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stavrolet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stavrolet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stavrolet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stavrolet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stavrolet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stavrolet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stavrolet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stavrolet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stavrolet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-27T11:07:22Z","updated_at":"2026-06-27T11:08:16Z","body":"I can't reproduce this bug on either 4.8.dev([commit](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/d7c45b19ccf6ddadc73d1c8423cd2848f59de437)) or 4.7.stable. Did you get this bug in GDExtension c++ code?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4817011698/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4818096040","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120661#issuecomment-4818096040","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120661","id":4818096040,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHy5PqA","user":{"login":"ghuser404","id":33043976,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMDQzOTc2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33043976?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghuser404","html_url":"https://github.com/ghuser404","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghuser404/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghuser404/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghuser404/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghuser404/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghuser404/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghuser404/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghuser404/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghuser404/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghuser404/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-27T13:51:38Z","updated_at":"2026-06-27T13:51:38Z","body":"@Stavrolet Yes, I'm using godot-cpp. I'll create a small repro project.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4818096040/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4818660246","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120661#issuecomment-4818660246","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120661","id":4818660246,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHzbrlg","user":{"login":"ghuser404","id":33043976,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMDQzOTc2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33043976?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghuser404","html_url":"https://github.com/ghuser404","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghuser404/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghuser404/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghuser404/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghuser404/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghuser404/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghuser404/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghuser404/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghuser404/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghuser404/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-27T15:12:28Z","updated_at":"2026-06-27T15:12:28Z","body":"@Stavrolet Here's the MRP [load-token-leak.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29412122/load-token-leak.zip)\n\n1. Make sure you export the project (debug, not sure about release, didn't try it), because those logs are not visible in the editor logs, maybe I don't know how to enable them there\n2. Run `.\\load-token-leak.exe` (the leak may not always show, try multiple times)\n3. Press \"Load scene\" button (it will open scene_2.tscn)\n4. Close app (alt+f4 or regular close)\n5. In the console you should see the leak message\n\nIn this particular project I get only 1 leaked instance\n> WARNING: 1 ObjectDB instance was leaked at exit (run with `--verbose` for details).","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4818660246/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4858862290","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120661#issuecomment-4858862290","iss